        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "The accelerator documentation must stay honest about ownership: the accelerator presents and composes journeys; backend modules and project extensions own business data and decisions. A storefront screenshot or UI component is useful evidence, but it cannot replace schema, API, data-pack, publication, and validation evidence."
        }
