          "text": "Official external references help readers understand industry-standard expectations for terms, data movement, administration, auditability, and operator evidence. They do not define Nodics behavior, architecture, code, data shape, or product direction. Nodics must never be presented as a copy, derivative, or reimplementation of another framework."
